          "objective_id": "o2",
          "question": "对初值问题，$Y(s)$ 的正确形式是？",
          "options": [
            "$1/((s-4)(s^2-1))$",
            "$1/((s-4)(s^2+1))$",
            "$1/((s+4)(s^2-1))$"
          ],
          "answer_index": 0,
          "explanation": "$\\mathcal{L}\\{y''-y\\}=(s^2-1)Y$；右边 $\\mathcal{L}\\{e^{4t}\\}=1/(s-4)$，所以 $Y=1/((s-4)(s^2-1))$。"
        }
      ],
      "scroll": "flow",
